This repository is a newer implementation/version of:
https://github.com/PjuralSzymon/growingnn

When implementing features, follow the existing architecture, naming style, and design philosophy of this repo first. Do not rewrite large parts unless necessary.

Core framework idea:
The framework is based on dynamic neural network architecture growth/shrinking during training. The main conceptual reference is:
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-63749-0_25

Each function should have at least one unit test